<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
      background: #faf7f2;
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d97706 0%, #b45309 100%);
      color: white;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
    }
    .content {
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;
      border: 1px solid #e7e2d8;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #d97706;
      color: white;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .temp-password {
      background: #fef3c7;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 18px;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border: 1px solid #d97706;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #57534e;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>Welcome to AICN, {{name}}! 🎉</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <p>Thank you for joining the <strong>Africa ICT &amp; CS Network</strong> training platform. We're excited to have you on board!</p>
    
    <h3>🎯 What you can do next:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Browse available training sessions</li>
      <li>Enroll in courses that match your interests</li>
      <li>Track your learning progress</li>
      <li>Earn certificates upon completion</li>
      {{#if (eq role "TRAINER")}}<li>Create and manage your own sessions</li>{{/if}}
    </ul>
    
    {{#if tempPassword}}
    <div class="temp-password">
      <strong>Temporary Password:</strong><br/>
      <code style="font-size: 20px; color: #b45309;">{{tempPassword}}</code>
      <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 10px;">Please change this password after your first login.</p>
    </div>
    {{/if}}
    
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="{{frontendUrl}}/sessions" class="button">Explore Sessions</a>
    </div>
    
    <p>If you have any questions, feel free to reply to this email or contact our support team at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #d97706;">{{supportEmail}}</a>.</p>
    <p>Best regards,<br><strong>The AICN Team</strong></p>
    <p style="font-style: italic; color: #d97706;">Empowering Africa Digitally, Transforming Lives</p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    <p>© {{year}} AICN Training. All rights reserved.</p>
    <p>You received this email because you registered on our platform.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>